# Title: Pass the Hash Activity 2
# ID: 8eef149c-bd26-49f2-9e5a-9b00e3af499b
# Status: stable
# Level: medium
# Author: Dave Kennedy, Jeff Warren (method) / David Vassallo (rule)
# Date: 2019-06-14
# Tags: attack.lateral-movement, attack.t1550.002
# Description: Detects the attack technique pass the hash which is used to move laterally inside the network
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" (((EventID=4624 AND SubjectUserSid="S-1-0-0" AND LogonType=3 AND LogonProcessName="NtLmSsp" AND KeyLength=0) OR (EventID=4624 AND LogonType=9 AND LogonProcessName="seclogo")) AND NOT ((TargetUserName="ANONYMOUS LOGON")))
